  "**RR's combined stack is roughly 9x the source's single live conversion category — not " +
  "because any RR number is large (the conversion Discoveries are at 45% of the source's) but " +
  "because RR gives each individual upgrade, drake, champion system and buff its own category. " +
  "Kittens has categories that are KINDS OF EFFECT; RR has categories that are INDIVIDUAL " +
  "EFFECTS.** Grouping RR's eleven factors into four source-shaped categories would cut the " +
  "product ~41%; collapsing to one would cut it ~80%. **It is a late-game change only — early " +
  "on almost every factor is 1.0, so a product and a sum are the same number — and it would " +
  "lengthen Era 3, which is already lengthening. It should ship in its own round with the " +
  "ensemble to itself, not beside anything else.**";
const KINDS = ["TECHS", "BUILDINGS", "UPGRADES", "JOBS", "CRAFTS", "EXPEDITIONS", "CHAMPIONS", "LEADS"];
