      // v0.61 PART 3.1 — THE GUARD THAT MAKES THE ARGUMENT PASS STICK.
      // **UNVERIFIED MUST MEAN ONLY "RETRIEVABLE AND NOT YET RETRIEVED."** A mechanism with no
